      "step_id": 0,
      "title": "Method details",
      "instruction": "This section presents the ODD+D protocol, an extension of the original protocol that includes more information on human decision-making. The protocol consists of three main parts: Overview, Design concepts, and Details, which are presented within this section.",
      "substeps": [],
      "is_critical": false,
